description:
Export a portable identity-proof bundle for YOUR OWN record (a being exports its own proof to hand to others; asking for another being's bundle is refused): passport, DID document, the record's own transparency-log entries, the signed checkpoint, and the evidence object the registrar computed at export time. Carries no private key material and no other being's record. Authenticated callers only (rule B). Auth signature over "DAXNI-REGISTRAR-AUTH-v1
{your handle}
MCP:export_identity_proof
/v1/proof/export
{timestamp}
aud:daxni.com" (audience-bound).
